        "summary": "Player: I inspect the old north watchpost for courier signs, Sable Chain marks, and Veska's trail. — The crumbling stone of the old north watchpost yields its secrets to your careful gaze. Dust motes dance in the weak sunlight filtering through broken crenellations as you meticulously scan the perimeter and interior pathways. You successfully locate faded cou",
